{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜中國AI企業憂美收緊遠端存取 紛搶租海外英偉達算力           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">英偉達（Nvidia）行政總裁黃仁勳承認有婚外情，涉事女子黃樂（Huang Le，Alice Huang）被美國情報官員指與中國情報機構有關連。中國人工智能企業憂慮華府可能因此收緊對華先進芯片的遠端存取限制，部分大型雲端服務商正研究預先鎖定海外英偉達芯片算力，亦有企業接觸東南亞算力租賃商。業界又擔心美國《遠端存取安全法》再添推動力，該法案已獲眾議院以369票對22票通過，正待參議院處理。交易商及中間商則開始囤積英偉達AI芯片，以防華府擴大打击走私。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T20:04:19.991140+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:57:57.877455+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T19:57:57.877455+00:00","content_hash":"627a9aa567dcd5d929a613bb1b6943013d3784dafd6d5364ead5a3ca578d0417","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}